# Cline rules (pointer)

The single source of truth for all project rules lives in [`AGENTS.md`](./AGENTS.md).
Read and follow it in full — do not duplicate or fork its rules here.

@AGENTS.md

**Cline-specific notes:**
- Branch-per-task on any tool; run `npm run verify` before merge.
- Never touch `.env` (gitignored, holds secrets) or `.vexp/` (live index).
